WEBVTT

00:04.626 --> 00:10.386
[ONYANKOPON] The plan failed.
Why does it always end this way?

00:11.596 --> 00:15.726
Violence will always be
a part of human existence,

00:15.806 --> 00:18.596
won't it, Captain?

00:18.686 --> 00:22.396
Why are you betraying us?
I don't understand, Conny!

00:22.476 --> 00:25.816
We were supposed to be on
the same side, no matter what!

00:25.896 --> 00:28.816
We still are on
the same side, Samuel!

00:30.156 --> 00:33.536
[CONNY]
But I... I just!

01:09.526 --> 01:10.566
[JAEGERIST 86B screams]

01:34.176 --> 01:37.346
[Roars]

01:44.436 --> 01:46.276
What?

01:46.356 --> 01:50.856
Back up. Say that again.

01:50.946 --> 01:53.276
I'm sorry, but it's the truth.

01:53.366 --> 01:55.076
We need an entire day
to service the boat

01:55.156 --> 01:57.116
before it will be able to fly.

01:57.196 --> 02:00.456
That time can probably be cut in
half with the right equipment,

02:00.536 --> 02:02.706
but even that
might be a stretch.

02:03.836 --> 02:05.876
Are you kidding me?

02:07.126 --> 02:08.756
You mean we have to
hold off the enemy

02:08.836 --> 02:11.716
for half a day while you work?

02:11.796 --> 02:15.386
You do realize
reinforcements are coming.

02:15.466 --> 02:18.346
There's no way we can protect
you and the port that long.

02:18.426 --> 02:21.726
Our Titans are only able to
fight for a few hours at a time.

02:21.806 --> 02:23.686
[HANGE]
We'll be too late.

02:25.436 --> 02:28.146
[HANGE] The rumbling can
outpace a sprinting horse,

02:28.226 --> 02:29.606
and there isn't a single
obstacle out there

02:29.686 --> 02:31.026
that can slow it down.

02:31.106 --> 02:34.566
It's an unyielding
wave of destruction.

02:34.656 --> 02:37.946
Half a day from now, they'll be
600 kilometers inland.

02:38.036 --> 02:40.496
Nothing in their
path will survive.

02:41.616 --> 02:45.036
[HANGE] They could flatten the
entire continent in four days.

02:45.126 --> 02:48.166
Four days.
That's all it'll take.

02:48.246 --> 02:49.756
[KIYOMI gasps]

02:49.836 --> 02:53.216
[HANGE] Even if we launch the
ship and manage to stop Eren...

02:54.636 --> 02:59.096
...Liberio will still fall.
There's no way to save it.

02:59.176 --> 03:00.346
[Gasps]

03:04.226 --> 03:05.556
Dammit.

03:09.186 --> 03:12.026
We still don't know
Eren's location.

03:12.106 --> 03:14.946
And time is working against us.

03:15.026 --> 03:17.616
More are dying each second.

03:17.696 --> 03:19.616
And regardless,
we've got no chance

03:19.696 --> 03:22.866
of holding out long enough
to ready the ship.

03:22.956 --> 03:24.576
There's no way.

03:25.496 --> 03:27.246
[KIYOMI]
I have an idea.

03:30.166 --> 03:32.126
[KIYOMI] Odiha is
a coastal city in Marley

03:32.216 --> 03:34.086
some distance to the south.

03:34.176 --> 03:36.176
We own and operate
a hanger there.

03:36.256 --> 03:37.676
If we can reach it,

03:37.756 --> 03:40.506
it'll be an ideal servicing
station for the flying boat.

03:40.596 --> 03:43.186
I think we should
set sail for that hangar now

03:43.266 --> 03:45.346
and tow the boat behind us.

03:45.436 --> 03:48.066
Then we can finish prepping it
for flight on the continent,

03:48.146 --> 03:50.106
under more favorable conditions.

03:50.186 --> 03:53.856
[HANGE] Interesting.
A city on the coast, huh?

03:53.946 --> 03:57.656
Hold on, isn't it about to be
wiped out by the rumbling?

03:57.736 --> 03:59.236
We would beat the Titans there.

03:59.326 --> 04:00.786
But I don't know
how much time we'd have

04:00.866 --> 04:02.076
before they caught up.

04:02.156 --> 04:04.286
I can only say that
we'd be cutting it close.

04:04.366 --> 04:06.916
This would be a gamble.

04:06.996 --> 04:08.576
[HANGE]
A gamble.

04:10.626 --> 04:11.836
Whatever the case,

04:11.916 --> 04:14.966
clearly we won't be
flying from this port.

04:15.046 --> 04:16.466
Does the ship have fuel?

04:16.546 --> 04:17.756
Uh, yes!

04:17.836 --> 04:19.806
But it'll take 30 minutes
to ready the boiler.

04:19.886 --> 04:22.426
[MAGATH] Make it 15!
If you screw up and die here,

04:22.516 --> 04:25.266
then Hizuru and the rest of
the world are doomed!

04:25.346 --> 04:26.726
So stay sharp!

04:26.806 --> 04:28.306
[HIZURU ENVOY]
Right!

04:28.396 --> 04:30.476
I'll go inform
Levi and the others.

04:30.566 --> 04:32.476
[HANGE] And I'll do
the same with Mikasa!

04:33.236 --> 04:38.236
♪ Opening Song ♪

06:14.586 --> 06:16.046
[JAEGERISTS groan]

06:19.336 --> 06:20.716
[JAEGERIST 86H]
You bitch!

06:25.346 --> 06:27.096
Have to change plans.

06:27.176 --> 06:29.886
We'll sail out of here and prep
the flying boat on the mainland.

06:29.976 --> 06:32.266
The mainland? All right.

06:32.346 --> 06:34.306
[MIKASA]
Help them board that ship!

06:37.436 --> 06:39.276
Faster! Go!

06:50.786 --> 06:53.826
It's the Azumabito
mechanics! Kill them!

06:58.086 --> 06:59.666
[HANGE yells]

07:03.876 --> 07:07.256
I'll kill you!
You damn traitors!

07:08.386 --> 07:11.056
[FLOCH] Why'd they
leave the safety of cover?

07:11.136 --> 07:13.476
What could be worth
taking that risk?

07:13.556 --> 07:14.346
[Gasps]

07:14.436 --> 07:16.146
[FLOCH]
No way.

07:19.186 --> 07:21.106
Reiner!

07:21.186 --> 07:22.276
[REINER TITAN roars]

07:22.356 --> 07:23.736
[JAEGERIST 86L]
No! Please!

07:33.786 --> 07:35.536
Don't stop moving!

07:36.786 --> 07:38.376
[JAEGERIST 86P yells]

07:41.256 --> 07:43.046
[JAEGERIST 86Q]
Forget the Female Titan!

07:43.126 --> 07:45.216
Kill the Azumabito!

07:50.766 --> 07:52.476
[ANNIE groans]

07:55.556 --> 07:59.646
[MAGATH] Get up!
We're nearly there, so go!

08:01.986 --> 08:04.066
[JAEGERIST 86V]
Take her down!

08:10.696 --> 08:13.156
[FLOCH]
Dammit. I don't believe this.

08:13.246 --> 08:14.916
They're actually planning
to try to make a break

08:14.996 --> 08:16.496
for the mainland?

08:17.416 --> 08:19.086
[REINER TITAN groans]

08:19.166 --> 08:21.336
[FLOCH]
Bring every last Thunder Spear!

08:21.416 --> 08:24.296
They plan on using
that ship to get to Eren.

08:24.376 --> 08:26.926
So make sure it never
leaves this dock.

08:27.006 --> 08:28.506
If they reach Eren and kill him,

08:28.586 --> 08:31.386
then Paradis will drown
in a sea of blood.

08:31.466 --> 08:33.056
The world will seek revenge

08:33.136 --> 08:35.596
and butcher your parents,
your siblings,

08:35.686 --> 08:37.726
and every kid on this island.

08:37.806 --> 08:40.016
Your hearts and souls,
to the cause!

08:46.026 --> 08:47.406
Oh, no.

08:49.366 --> 08:50.366
[ONYANKOPON]
It looks like the Jaegerists

08:50.446 --> 08:51.906
are aiming for the boat.

08:51.986 --> 08:53.576
Our Titans won't last long.

08:53.656 --> 08:56.246
Not if they keep on
taking shots like that.

08:58.166 --> 09:00.206
[REINER TITAN groans]

09:00.286 --> 09:02.836
I should be fighting with them.

09:02.916 --> 09:05.506
I can use the power
of the Jaw Titan.

09:05.586 --> 09:07.086
[PIECK TITAN]
Bad idea.

09:07.176 --> 09:09.636
First transformations
never go well.

09:09.716 --> 09:11.466
[FALCO]
But at this rate--

09:11.556 --> 09:13.466
Leave the fight to me.

09:13.556 --> 09:17.476
After I get you all onto the
ship, I'll back up the others.

09:18.306 --> 09:21.516
I'm so useless.
If only it were Galliard here.

09:24.566 --> 09:26.606
[FALCO] He wouldn't be
sitting on his hands

09:26.686 --> 09:28.566
wondering what to do.

09:31.446 --> 09:32.236
[GABI]
No! Come back!

09:32.326 --> 09:33.866
Don't follow.

09:34.786 --> 09:37.196
I need to drop you all
off on that ship.

09:38.456 --> 09:40.826
[MAGATH] Quickly!
Get that boiler going!

09:40.916 --> 09:42.076
Huh?

09:43.836 --> 09:45.456
[MAGATH]
Conny!

09:45.546 --> 09:47.966
Armin was shot in the chest.

09:48.046 --> 09:49.636
And the face, too.

09:49.716 --> 09:52.756
He should heal fast,
though. Can you--?

09:52.846 --> 09:54.506
[CONNY]
I'll guard the ship!

09:59.226 --> 10:01.476
[PIECK TITAN]
Commander, Falco's out there.

10:01.556 --> 10:02.766
[Gasps]

10:09.656 --> 10:12.946
[HANGE gasps]
Reinforcements! Dammit.

10:13.026 --> 10:15.536
Unless we do
something about them,

10:15.616 --> 10:18.446
we'll be killed along with
most of humanity.

10:25.546 --> 10:26.666
[HANGE gasps]

10:28.836 --> 10:31.756
We needed those reinforcements.

10:31.836 --> 10:33.966
How'd they take the train out?

10:44.146 --> 10:47.646
[JEAN] What are you doing,
Falco? Get on the ship!

10:47.726 --> 10:49.356
[FALCO]
Right!

10:49.436 --> 10:50.566
[Gasps]

10:58.536 --> 11:00.036
[Gasps]

11:00.116 --> 11:03.666
[REINER]
My body--it won't move!

11:03.746 --> 11:06.666
[ANNIE]
Can't see anything.

11:06.746 --> 11:08.836
This is it! Finish them off!

11:08.916 --> 11:12.586
[CONNY yells]

11:20.306 --> 11:21.386
Conny!

11:21.476 --> 11:23.596
Piece of shit traitor.
Just die already!

11:23.686 --> 11:25.146
Conny!

11:36.776 --> 11:38.696
[JEAN]
Hesitate...

11:38.786 --> 11:42.536
[MIKASA] ...for even a second,
and your comrades die.

11:45.166 --> 11:46.826
[JAEGERISTS scream]

11:50.456 --> 11:51.376
What now, Floch?

11:51.456 --> 11:52.756
We keep fighting!

11:52.836 --> 11:55.086
We still have the tools
to take these traitors down.

11:55.176 --> 11:59.256
Attack in unison! Nail the Cart
with Thunder Spears!

12:06.186 --> 12:08.016
Back off! Damn!

12:18.406 --> 12:21.826
[FLOCH] We'll stop them.
Even if it costs us our lives!

12:21.906 --> 12:24.916
'Cause our country
is worth dying for!

12:34.586 --> 12:36.926
[FALCO TITAN roars]

12:42.016 --> 12:44.476
--[FALCO TITAN roars]
--It's Falco!

12:45.936 --> 12:47.266
[JAEGERISTS groan]

12:48.306 --> 12:52.606
[Roars]

12:53.896 --> 12:54.936
Falco!

12:55.026 --> 12:56.566
Come on! They're
out of formation,

12:56.656 --> 12:57.816
so this is our chance!

12:57.906 --> 12:59.616
Now or never!

13:03.576 --> 13:04.696
[MIKASA grunts]

13:11.246 --> 13:15.416
[Roars]

13:16.676 --> 13:19.796
[Yells]

13:32.106 --> 13:34.316
[FLOCH]
It all comes down to this shot.

13:34.396 --> 13:37.186
If I can just put a hole
in the ship, then we win.

13:37.276 --> 13:38.656
[PIECK gasps]

13:41.566 --> 13:42.866
[Gasps]

13:44.576 --> 13:49.916
[FLOCH] I'm gonna save
the Eldian Empire. Right now!

14:03.886 --> 14:04.636
[JAEGERIST 86AQ]
Floch!

14:04.716 --> 14:05.966
[JAEGERIST 86AS screams]

14:13.516 --> 14:15.356
[MIKASA grunts]

14:18.946 --> 14:20.776
[JAEGERIST 86AW gasps]

14:23.316 --> 14:25.536
[MIKASA grunts]

14:47.926 --> 14:50.976
[JAEGERISTS screaming]

14:53.056 --> 14:56.186
We're ready to sail!
Come aboard!

14:56.276 --> 14:57.646
[HANGE]
Let's go. Quick.

14:57.726 --> 14:59.486
Before they have
time to regroup.

14:59.566 --> 15:00.736
[JEAN gasps]

15:00.816 --> 15:02.026
[JEAN]
Watch it!

15:10.446 --> 15:15.376
[Roars]

15:15.456 --> 15:16.746
Falco!

15:16.836 --> 15:19.336
The enemy's retreating!
Come out!

15:22.086 --> 15:23.176
[Gasps]

15:25.886 --> 15:28.056
[MAGATH]
Pieck! Hold him still!

15:28.136 --> 15:29.516
[Gasps]

15:32.476 --> 15:34.056
Falco, stop!

15:41.896 --> 15:45.156
[MAGATH]
You're okay. I got you.

15:45.236 --> 15:47.696
Rest up for now,
you've earned it.

15:59.916 --> 16:00.666
Take him.

16:00.756 --> 16:01.756
Of course.

16:01.836 --> 16:02.916
Tell them to set out.

16:03.006 --> 16:04.546
Huh? Aren't you coming?

16:04.636 --> 16:06.756
No, I need to hold the rear.

16:20.646 --> 16:23.436
We're really lucky
the commander got to him.

16:23.526 --> 16:25.066
Yeah.

16:25.156 --> 16:27.316
Things were looking
pretty bleak back there.

16:27.406 --> 16:30.826
Hey, wait a sec.
Where is the commander?

16:32.156 --> 16:33.956
It's "General" now.

16:37.496 --> 16:39.206
[JAEGERIST 86AZ]
Enemy spotted!

16:39.286 --> 16:41.756
One stayed behind. Get him!

16:45.416 --> 16:47.086
[JAEGERISTS groan]

16:55.556 --> 16:56.556
[MAGATH]
You're the one who took out

16:56.636 --> 16:59.516
their reinforcements,
aren't you?

17:00.896 --> 17:02.476
[KEITH]
I am.

17:03.896 --> 17:06.736
Why didn't you take to sea
with the others?

17:09.736 --> 17:13.746
[MAGATH] That floating giant's
a captured Marleyan cruiser.

17:13.826 --> 17:15.616
It's fast enough to
catch up with their ship

17:15.706 --> 17:19.666
and sink them along with
humanity's hopes.

17:19.746 --> 17:21.166
I can't allow that.

17:21.246 --> 17:22.956
Need to put it
underwater somehow.

17:23.046 --> 17:24.966
I'll give you a hand.

17:33.306 --> 17:34.846
They'll be here soon.

17:34.926 --> 17:36.676
Let him come.

17:36.766 --> 17:40.226
This'll be ready to blow
before they can break in.

17:40.306 --> 17:43.606
Last chance for you
to take a swim.

17:43.686 --> 17:45.816
No. I'll stay.

17:45.896 --> 17:48.776
I've been looking for
a good end to this life.

17:50.156 --> 17:52.656
What made you decide
to help us out?

17:52.736 --> 17:56.116
There's a chance that
you've doomed your island.

17:58.706 --> 18:01.416
Saw some former
students of mine.

18:01.496 --> 18:05.006
Traveling south
out of Shiganshina.

18:05.086 --> 18:07.916
Annie Leonhart was with them.

18:08.006 --> 18:12.006
When I realized what
their plan was, I was moved.

18:13.136 --> 18:16.726
And I was proud to see
how much they'd grown.

18:16.806 --> 18:20.186
[MAGATH] If you hadn't stopped
that train, they'd be dead.

18:20.266 --> 18:23.316
And they're not
the only ones in your debt.

18:23.396 --> 18:25.066
When the dust settles,

18:25.146 --> 18:28.316
you'll be known as one of the
heroes who saved the world.

18:28.396 --> 18:32.026
Well, then,
that makes two of us.

18:34.236 --> 18:37.076
[MAGATH] I've done nothing
to be proud of.

18:38.156 --> 18:41.666
I served my country by
ignoring my conscience.

18:41.746 --> 18:43.786
They were innocent kids

18:43.876 --> 18:47.206
till I got ahold of them and
turned them into soldiers.

18:47.296 --> 18:49.966
I ordered them to
breach those walls.

18:51.006 --> 18:55.886
[MAGATH] It's far too late,
but I've finally realized

18:55.966 --> 18:58.726
how happy I would've been...

18:58.806 --> 19:02.896
...if those kids could've
lived normal lives.

19:05.476 --> 19:09.816
[KEITH] Well, you might not
think you deserve it, but still,

19:09.896 --> 19:12.446
I've got plenty respect for you.

19:12.526 --> 19:13.776
You there! Stop!

19:13.856 --> 19:15.656
Open this door, dammit!

19:15.736 --> 19:17.196
What are you doing in there?

19:17.286 --> 19:20.036
And those kids would
probably say the same.

19:20.116 --> 19:21.366
So...

19:22.286 --> 19:23.666
Thank you.

19:24.786 --> 19:28.086
Before I shoot, who are you?

19:28.166 --> 19:30.626
My name is Keith Shadis.

19:30.716 --> 19:32.466
And what's yours?

19:34.426 --> 19:36.386
Theo Magath.

19:46.686 --> 19:48.936
[Inaudible]

20:10.956 --> 20:15.966
♪ Ending Song ♪

21:42.466 --> 21:46.266
[HANGE] We conferred with Magath
and decided to head for Odiha.

21:46.346 --> 21:50.976
Though, to be perfectly honest,
we didn't have any other option.

21:53.106 --> 21:56.486
[HANGE] I'm afraid this means
we can't save your hometown.

21:56.566 --> 21:59.856
Liberio's doomed. I'm sorry.

22:04.996 --> 22:08.866
[ANNIE]
If that's true, I'm done.

22:08.956 --> 22:12.126
The only reason I had
to keep fighting is gone.

22:13.706 --> 22:16.006
[ANNIE]
I'm getting off the ship.

22:17.466 --> 22:19.006
[HANGE]
Even if all went well

22:19.086 --> 22:22.176
and we stopped
the rumbling in its tracks,

22:22.256 --> 22:27.386
Liberio and Marley were always
going to be trampled flat.

22:27.476 --> 22:29.976
Magath understood that.

22:30.056 --> 22:33.266
Yet he chose to give his life

22:33.356 --> 22:35.976
so we'd have the chance
to push forward.

22:36.066 --> 22:40.816
He died, not for
Liberio or for Marley,

22:40.906 --> 22:42.776
but in the hopes that
it would help us save

22:42.866 --> 22:47.246
at least one more stranger,
whose name he'll never know.

22:49.826 --> 22:55.046
[ANNIE] In that case, I'll ask
you this question once more.

22:55.126 --> 22:58.506
Be honest. You think
you can kill Eren?

23:01.006 --> 23:02.756
[ANNIE]
Think hard.

23:02.836 --> 23:06.596
If I try to kill him,
what will you do?

23:07.676 --> 23:10.636
Can you sit by and watch?

23:13.516 --> 23:15.436
Cause...

23:15.516 --> 23:17.526
I'm sick of this.

23:17.606 --> 23:19.526
I'm so tired.

23:19.606 --> 23:22.066
I don't want to fight anymore.

23:26.826 --> 23:28.946
[ANNIE]
Not with any of you.

23:30.206 --> 23:32.616
[ANNIE]
Not even with Eren.

23:41.086 --> 23:43.546
[NARRATOR]
The events witnessed that day.

23:43.626 --> 23:45.336
The ideas exchanged.

23:45.426 --> 23:47.176
The choices made.

23:47.256 --> 23:51.926
All of it happened
in accordance with his will.

23:52.016 --> 23:54.936
Next episode:
"The Dawn of Humanity."
